{"id":"n24893-1-7","stage":3,"title":"창가 · 窗边","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24893-1-7-1","ko":"빛이 강해서 눈을 제대로 뜰 수가 없어요.","zh":"光线太强了，根本没法正常睁开眼睛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"빛이","meaning":"光，光线","explanation":"빛：光，光线；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"빛","audio":"/audio/bcfe8128a79515eee12a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62079","senseId":"1","lemma":"빛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"강해서","meaning":"强，强大","explanation":"강하다：强，强大；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"강하다","audio":"/audio/3729168fab098be4af52.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64002","senseId":"2","lemma":"강하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈을","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제대로","meaning":"正常地，正规地","explanation":"제대로：正常地，正规地","readings":[{"term":"제대로","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70896","senseId":"1","lemma":"제대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뜰","meaning":"睁，睁开","explanation":"뜨다：睁，睁开；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"뜨다","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62313","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어요.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bcfe8128a79515ee","term":"빛","zh":"光，光线","audio":"/audio/bcfe8128a79515eee12a.mp3","entryId":"62079","definition":"从太阳、月亮、电灯、火等处散发出来，照亮事物的东西。","pronunciation":["빋"]},{"id":"3729168fab098be4","term":"강하다","zh":"强，强大","audio":"/audio/3729168fab098be4af52.mp3","entryId":"64002","definition":"水平或程度高。","pronunciation":["강하다"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼睛","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人或动物的一种感觉器官，位于脸部，受光线刺激后能看到物体。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"085882b8f444c8cf","term":"제대로","zh":"正常地，正规地","audio":"/audio/085882b8f444c8cf0f5f.mp3","entryId":"70896","definition":"以正确格式或标准、样子。","pronunciation":["제대로"]},{"id":"83c29e672f4ac6fe","term":"뜨다","zh":"睁，睁开","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3","entryId":"62313","definition":"张开闭着的眼睛。","pronunciation":["뜨다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe9fa18bcbcbe6fe4c4d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24893-1-7-2","ko":"창가에 커튼을 달면 어때요?","zh":"在窗边装上窗帘怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"창가에","meaning":"窗边，窗旁","explanation":"창가：窗边，窗旁；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"창가","audio":"/audio/72b7604bc394b3b2ca4c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24893","senseId":"1","lemma":"창가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커튼을","meaning":"窗帘","explanation":"커튼：窗帘；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"커튼","audio":"/audio/11324bd0fb7b6e5f051f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72166","senseId":"1","lemma":"커튼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달면","meaning":"挂，悬，别，带","explanation":"달다：挂，悬，别，带；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64533","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"72b7604bc394b3b2","term":"창가","zh":"窗边，窗旁","audio":"/audio/72b7604bc394b3b2ca4c.mp3","entryId":"24893","definition":"离窗户较近的地方或旁边。","pronunciation":["창까"]},{"id":"11324bd0fb7b6e5f","term":"커튼","zh":"窗帘","audio":"/audio/11324bd0fb7b6e5f051f.mp3","entryId":"72166","definition":"为了遮挡窗或门而挂在其上方的长形垂布。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"bb552fc456991067","term":"달다","zh":"挂，悬，别，带","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3","entryId":"64533","definition":"将物品拴挂或插在某处，使其不掉落。","pronunciation":["달다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/b65caeab83f4610bb008.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.989,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24893","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":108,"sequenceScore":2.8157,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["在窗边装上窗帘怎么样？","光线太强了，根本没法正常睁开眼睛。","父亲，请指点一下我的围棋吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["光线太强了，根本没法正常睁开眼睛。","父亲，请指点一下我的围棋吧。","在窗边装上窗帘怎么样？"],"answer":2}]}
